{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#928","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#928","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#928\",\"parent_revision\":\"20e6eecd94e63df9780647da9b240423de131e1a\",\"root_revision\":\"10446f40443b53e7af5a364d5248d7a3de1d24f3ba8a07ad900b19c3718970fb\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd a WorktreeCreate hook that auto-runs uv sync and uv run prek install when worktrees are created for parallel agent work. Workers in /work-milestone need dependencies installed in their worktrees. Pattern sourced from Citadel worktree-setup.js \u2014 adapted for our uv-based toolchain.\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAssessment date: 2026-04-23\\n\\n| # | Condition | Status | Source |\\n|---|-----------|--------|--------|\\n| 1 | WorktreeCreate hook event exists in Claude Code | DERIVABLE | Check Claude Code hook events documentation |\\n| 2 | Citadel worktree-setup.js pattern available as reference | AVAILABLE | Item description names the source |\\n| 3 | `.claude/hooks/` uses JavaScript (Node.js) .cjs pattern | AVAILABLE | Language conventions rule + existing hooks |\\n| 4 | `uv sync` and `uv run prek install` are the correct setup commands | AVAILABLE | CLAUDE.md session start instructions |\\n\\nVerdict: READY \u2014 one verification needed (WorktreeCreate event name in Claude Code API).\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **worktree setup hook for uv-based projects** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Citadel assessment .claude/reports/citadel-assessment-20260320.md\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\nP1 Feature. Additive only. Hook failure non-blocking by design. Low risk.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- A WorktreeCreate hook script exists at `.claude/hooks/worktree-setup.cjs` (JavaScript, Node.js)\\n- Hook runs `uv sync` in the new worktree directory on WorktreeCreate event\\n- Hook runs `uv run prek install` after `uv sync` completes\\n- Hook failure (uv not found, prek install error) is logged to stderr but does not fail the worktree creation\\n- Hook registered in `.claude/hooks/hooks.json` under WorktreeCreate event\\n- Worktrees created for `/work-milestone` or `implement-feature` parallel work have deps installed automatically\\n- Regression: standard single-worktree sessions are unaffected (hook is WorktreeCreate-only)\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `.claude/hooks/worktree-setup.cjs` \u2014 new WorktreeCreate hook script\\n- `.claude/hooks/hooks.json` \u2014 register WorktreeCreate hook\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs a developer using parallel agent worktrees via `implement-feature`, I need a WorktreeCreate hook that auto-runs `uv sync` and `uv run prek install` in each new worktree so agents have all dependencies available without manual setup.\\n\",\"digest\":\"055421dc07e38a1e31e2b221dc72095502c615325dc8c777539f66bc90c64198\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgyZbA\"}"}